# Task workflow

Follow [00-tool-routing.mdc](./00-tool-routing.mdc) for tool choice.

## Non-trivial work

Understand the task → **one** primary discovery tool → read only identified files → plan if significant → implement → validate per [verification skill](../skills/verification/SKILL.md).

Skip planning for typos, one-line fixes, and obvious local edits. Do not explore the entire repository or re-query the same discovery question with a second MCP.

## Bugs

Do not patch until the failing path is identified. Separate confirmed findings from hypotheses. Trace UI → `useAppData` / `DatabaseService` → storage when classroom data is involved.

## After changes

Inspect the diff → `/verify` or smallest relevant validation. Investigate only failures related to the change.
